Description: use the TCS3701 ambient light stream on Xiaomi marble
 The on-change channel can stay at zero. Prefer ambient_light_cal_strm
 when present and read its light field through the standard light API.
 Keep the sensor alive until queued measurement callbacks have finished.
Forwarded: no
